---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Page title="mycellm_ — Free AI, powered by the crowd" description="Distributed LLM inference. Chat for free, powered by GPUs worldwide. No signup. Open source.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 sm:px-6 py-10 sm:py-16">
    <div class="w-full max-w-xl text-center space-y-6">
      <div class="flex justify-center mb-2">
        <img src="/brand/logo-icon/svg/mycellm-red-logo-sans.svg" alt=""
             class="w-14 h-14 sm:w-16 sm:h-16 animate-pulse"
             style="filter: drop-shadow(0px 0px 16px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.5));">
      </div>

      <div>
        <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white leading-tight">
          Free AI, <span class="text-spore-glow text-glow">powered by the crowd</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm sm:text-base mt-3 max-w-md mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Ask anything — served by GPUs worldwide on the mycellm distributed network. No signup.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="relative">
        <textarea id="heroInput" rows="2" placeholder="Ask anything..."
          class="w-full glass-green rounded-2xl px-4 sm:px-5 py-3.5 sm:py-4 pr-14 text-white text-base sm:text-lg resize-none transition-all focus:outline-none focus:border-spore/40 focus:shadow-[0_0_0_3px_rgba(34,197,94,0.08)]"
          onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'&&!event.shiftKey){event.preventDefault();sessionStorage.setItem('mycellm_initial_prompt',this.value);location.href='/chat'}"></textarea>
        <button onclick="sessionStorage.setItem('mycellm_initial_prompt',document.getElementById('heroInput').value);location.href='/chat'"
          class="absolute right-3 bottom-3 w-9 h-9 sm:w-10 sm:h-10 bg-spore text-black rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-spore/20 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-transform">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>

      <p class="text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] text-gray-700 flex items-center justify-center space-x-1">
        <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="text-ledger shrink-0"><path d="M12 9v4M12 17h.01M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 001.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 001.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 00-3.42 0z"/></svg>
        <span>Prompts processed by distributed GPU nodes. Don't share passwords or API keys.</span>
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 pt-1">
        <button onclick="sessionStorage.setItem('mycellm_initial_prompt','Explain distributed computing in simple terms');location.href='/chat'"
          class="text-xs glass rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:border-white/20 transition-colors cursor-pointer">Explain distributed computing</button>
        <button onclick="sessionStorage.setItem('mycellm_initial_prompt','Write a Python function to find prime numbers');location.href='/chat'"
          class="text-xs glass rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:border-white/20 transition-colors cursor-pointer">Write a Python function</button>
        <button onclick="sessionStorage.setItem('mycellm_initial_prompt','What makes P2P networks resilient?');location.href='/chat'"
          class="text-xs glass rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:border-white/20 transition-colors cursor-pointer">P2P network resilience</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Why distributed -->
  <section class="border-t border-white/5 bg-[#050505]">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14 sm:py-20">

      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white text-center mb-10">
        Why <span class="text-compute">distributed</span> inference?
      </h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
        <div class="glass rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2">
          <div class="text-spore text-lg">No single point of failure</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
            Models run across multiple peers. If one node goes down, requests route to another. No datacenter outage takes the whole network offline.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="glass rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2">
          <div class="text-relay text-lg">Your GPU, your credits</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
            Contribute idle compute and earn credits. Spend credits to run larger models. A fair exchange — not a subscription.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="glass rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2">
          <div class="text-ledger text-lg">No vendor lock-in</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
            OpenAI-compatible API. Switch between mycellm and any other provider with one env var. Your tools, your choice.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="glass rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2">
          <div class="text-poison text-lg">Private networks</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
            Run your own swarm for your team or org. Full control over who joins, what models run, and how data is handled. Invite-only access.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="glass rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2">
          <div class="text-compute text-lg">Open source</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
            Apache 2.0 licensed. Audit the code, fork it, extend it. No black boxes, no hidden data collection.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="glass rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2">
          <div class="text-spore-glow text-lg">Scales with community</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
            Every new seeder makes the network faster. More contributors = more models, lower latency, higher availability.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Quick start -->
  <section class="border-t border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14 sm:py-20">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white text-center mb-2">Get started in 60 seconds</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-center text-sm mb-8">pip, Docker, or one-liner — your choice.</p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
        <div class="glass rounded-xl p-5">
          <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-mono uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">pip</div>
          <div class="font-mono text-sm space-y-1.5">
            <div><span class="text-gray-600">$</span> <span class="text-spore-glow">pip install mycellm</span></div>
            <div><span class="text-gray-600">$</span> <span class="text-spore-glow">mycellm init</span></div>
            <div><span class="text-gray-600">$</span> <span class="text-spore-glow">mycellm serve</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="glass rounded-xl p-5">
          <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-mono uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Docker</div>
          <div class="font-mono text-xs text-spore-glow break-all leading-relaxed">
            docker run -d --name mycellm<br>-p 8420:8420<br>-v mycellm-data:/data/mycellm<br>ghcr.io/mycellm/mycellm
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="glass rounded-xl p-5">
          <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-mono uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">One-liner</div>
          <div class="font-mono text-sm text-spore-glow break-all">
            curl -fsSL mycellm.dev/install.sh | sh
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-3">Installs, initializes, prints next steps.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center mt-8">
        <a href="/join" class="inline-block bg-spore text-black font-semibold text-sm px-6 py-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-spore-glow transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-spore/20">
          Join the network &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- OpenAI compatible -->
  <section class="border-t border-white/5 bg-[#050505]">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14 sm:py-20">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white text-center mb-2">Drop-in OpenAI replacement</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-center text-sm mb-8">Change one env var. Everything else stays the same.</p>

      <div class="max-w-lg mx-auto glass rounded-xl p-5 font-mono text-sm space-y-2">
        <div class="text-gray-500"># Point any OpenAI-compatible tool at mycellm</div>
        <div><span class="text-gray-500">export</span> <span class="text-relay">OPENAI_BASE_URL</span><span class="text-gray-400">=</span><span class="text-spore-glow">http://localhost:8420/v1</span></div>
        <div class="text-gray-500 mt-4"># Works with:</div>
        <div class="text-gray-400">Python SDK &middot; LangChain &middot; LlamaIndex &middot; OpenCode &middot; Claude Code &middot; aider &middot; Continue.dev</div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center mt-6">
        <a href="/integrations/openai/" class="text-spore text-sm hover:text-spore-glow transition-colors">View integration guides &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Page>
